8/2023\n\nTOI XAC NHAN RANG TREN CO SO KHI CONG TY THANH TOAN SO TIEN NEU TREN CHO NGUOI DUOC UY QUYEN, CONG\n\nTY DUOC:\n\n1) MIEN TRU KHOI MOI KHIEU NAI HAY YEU CAU BOI THUONG CUA TOI DOI VOI CONG TY VE KHOAN THANH TOAN NOI\n\nTREN.\n\n2) TOI BOI HOAN VA GIU CHO CONG TY KHONG PHAI CHI TRA BAT KY KHOAN TIEN GI DOI VOI TAT CA CAC YEU CAU,\n\nKHIEU NAI, NGHIA VU NO, TON THAT, CHI PHI PHAT SINH LIEN QUAN DEN HAY DO VIEC CONG TY THANH TOAN\n\nKHOAN TIEN NAY CHO NGUOI DUOC UY QUYEN NEU TREN.\n\nGIAY UY QUYEN NAY CHI CO HIEU LUC TRONG VONG BA (03) THANG KE TU NGAY KY VA CO GIA TRI RANG BUOC DOI VOI\n\nNHUNG NGUOI DAI DIEN CUA CA NHAN TOI, NHUNG NGUOI THUA KE VA/ HOAC QUAN LY DI SAN CUA TOI.\n\nBEN MUA BAO  CHUYEN VIEN TU VAN BAO HIEM DUOC UY  NGUOI LAM  XAC NHAN CUA\n\nHIEM  QUYEN  CHUNG  ADM\n\n(KY VA GHI RO HO TEN)  (KY VA GHI RO HO TEN)  (KY VA GHI RO HO TEN)  (KY VA GHI RO HO TEN)\n\nGIAY UY QUYEN PHAI KEM BAN SAO GIAY TO TUY THAN CUA CA HAI BEN\n\nLUU Y: DE NGHI BEN MUA BAO HIEM KY DUNG VOI CHU KY DA DANG KY GIAO DICH VOI CONG TY\n\nPOSF4334", "html": "<p>SO 129 HOANG VAN THU, LOC THO, NHA TRANG,</p>\n<p>KHANH HOA</p>\n<p>Tel: 0827046084</p>\n<p>www.congtytnhhbaohiemn.vn</p>\n<p>CONG TY TNHH BAO HIEM NHAN THO VIET TIN TRUNG TAM DICH VU KHACH HANG</p>\n<h1>GIAY UY QUYEN NHAN TIEN</h1>\n<h2>(CHI AP DUNG CHO TRUONG HOP UY QUYEN CHO CHUYEN VIEN TU VAN BAO HIEM NHAN PHI BAO HIEM HOAN LAI VOI SO TIEN NHO HON</h2>\n<h2>5.000.000 DONG)</h2>\n<p>HO VA TEN (CHU IN HOA) HUYNH THI NGA</p>\n<p>SO CMND 744265172</p>\n<p>NGAY CAP 23/06/2011</p>\n<p>NOI CAP TPHCM</p>\n<p>LA BEN MUA BAO HIEM CUA HOP DONG BAO HIEM/HO SO YEU CAU BAO HIEM SO: 43440261</p>\n<p>HO VA TEN (CHU IN HOA) CHU VAN LAM</p>\n<p>SO CMND 921141483</p>\n<p>NGAY CAP 09/12/2014</p>\n<p>NOI CAP BINH DUONG</p>\n<p>DIA CHI HAI CHAU 1 - HAI CHAU - DA NANG</p>\n<p>MA SO TU VAN 81601542</p>\n<p>DIEN THOAI 0930191182</p>\n<p>BANG SO: 4,085,000</p>\n<p>BANG CHU: BON TRIEU KHONG TRAM TAM MUOI LAM NGHIN DONG</p>\n<p>THEO THONG